+
+All four rules are `DEFINITION`. They are the guarded branches of the
+`[function, total]` symbol `chooseNumSpec(Int, Int)`:
+
+1. `rule-05e369c2e0f0a26d0d7e674102a669feb198db11697b02b0e440dae13cd6c789`
